The house should protect from sun, rain, and wind while allowing air and light. This can be achieved through windows or a screened open space under the roof along the wall length. Ensure a walkway for workers of at least 1 meter and keep the area free of 
sharp objects that could injure the cattle. 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s16 \intbl\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\insrsid7431811\charrsid11022883 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}The floor should be non-slip, comfortable for cows to lie on, and designed }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs24\insrsid12669642\charrsid11022883 to ensure rapid drainage and prevent liquid retention.
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\qj \li0\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\intbl\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\pararsid11022883\yts15 \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f31506\fs22\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 
{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs24\insrsid7431811\charrsid11022883 Dimensions for Highland/Mid-highland housing (standing and lying area):
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s16 \intbl\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\insrsid920297\charrsid11022883 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard\plain \ltrpar\s16\qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\sl360\slmult1
\widctlpar\intbl\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\pararsid11022883\yts15\contextualspace \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f31506\fs22\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs24\insrsid920297\charrsid11022883 Bulls:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs24\insrsid7431811\charrsid11022883  2 meters (4 cubits) length by 1.2 meters (2.5 cubits) width. 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s16 \intbl\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\insrsid7431811\charrsid11022883 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Cows: 1.75 meters (3.5 cubits) length by 1.2 meters (1.5 cubits) width. 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s16 \intbl\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\insrsid7431811\charrsid11022883 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Heifers: 1.5 meters (3 cubits) length by 1 meter (2 cubits) width. 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s16 \intbl\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\insrsid7431811\charrsid11022883 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Calves: 1 meter (2 cubits) length by 1 meter (2 cubits) width. 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s16 \intbl\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\insrsid7431811\charrsid11022883 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
In Lowland areas, build an open-stall system without partitioned standing/lying areas, allowing 3.5 square meters per animal. 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s16 \intbl\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\insrsid8344649\charrsid11022883 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs24\insrsid8344649\charrsid11022883 
Build a drainage channel 20 cm deep and 15 cm wide, with an appropriate slope to prevent the stagnation of urine and other liquids.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s16 \intbl\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\insrsid7431811\charrsid11022883 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs24\insrsid7431811\charrsid11022883 Feeding Trough Dimensions:

\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s16 \intbl\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\insrsid7431811\charrsid11022883 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Cows/Bulls: 0.6 meters (2 cubits) width, 0.4 meters depth, and 1.20 meters length. 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s16 \intbl\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\insrsid7431811\charrsid11022883 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Heifers: 0.5 meters width, 0.4 meters depth, and 1 meter length. 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s16 \intbl\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\insrsid7431811\charrsid11022883 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Calves: 0.4 meters width, 0.15 meters depth, and 1 meter (2 cubits) length. 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s16 \intbl\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\insrsid7431811\charrsid11022883 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
Maternity/Sick pens should be 4 meters (8 cubits) by 4 meters (8 cubits) with fully covered, clean walls. The floor should be bedded with clean grass or straw, and sufficient clean water must be provided. 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s16 \intbl\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\insrsid7431811\charrsid11022883 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Separate rooms for feed storage and equipment storage are required. 
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\qj \li0\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\intbl\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\pararsid7023275\yts15 \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f31506\fs22\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {
\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs24\insrsid7431811\charrsid7023275 Regarding Manure Management and Utilization:
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s16 \intbl\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\insrsid7431811\charrsid11022883 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard\plain \ltrpar\s16\qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\sl360\slmult1
\widctlpar\intbl\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\pararsid11022883\yts15\contextualspace \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f31506\fs22\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs24\insrsid7431811\charrsid11022883 
If manure and urine are not properly managed, moisture and ammonia gas levels increase, reducing the cattle's feed intake. It also creates breeding grounds for flies and pathogens; therefore, clean the barn daily and clean feed and water troughs two to th
ree times a week. 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s16 \intbl\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\insrsid16651798\charrsid11022883 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs24\insrsid16651798\charrsid11022883 
Appropriately store cattle waste, which contains valuable nitrogen, phosphorus, and potassium, to be used as organic fertilizer. Alternatively, collect it in a sealed pit for anaerobic fermentation to produce biogas as a renewable energy source.}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs24\insrsid16651798\charrsid11022883 
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\qj \li0\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\intbl\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\pararsid7023275\yts15 \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f31506\fs22\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {
\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs24\insrsid7431811\charrsid7023275 To prepare compost: 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s16 \intbl\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\insrsid7431811\charrsid11022883 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard\plain \ltrpar\s16\qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\sl360\slmult1
\widctlpar\intbl\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\pararsid11022883\yts15\contextualspace \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f31506\fs22\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs24\insrsid7431811\charrsid11022883 Prepare at least two pits in a shaded area with convenient water access. 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s16 \intbl\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\insrsid7431811\charrsid11022883 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
Gather decomposable materials such as cattle manure slurry, feed leftovers, barn sweepings, and dry/wet plant matter. 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s16 \intbl\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\insrsid7431811\charrsid11022883 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
Add the decomposable materials to the pit sequentially. Ensure the amount of material added balances the moisture of the manure slurry. 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s16 \intbl\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\insrsid7431811\charrsid11022883 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}After 2\endash 
3 weeks when the first pit is full, move the manure to the second pit to allow the first to fully ferment. Use the fermented compost as fertilizer. 
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\qj \li0\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\intbl\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\pararsid11022883\yts15 \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f31506\fs22\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 
