Identifying signs of oestrus ("heat") and performing timely breeding are essential for maintaining proper calving intervals and ensuring consistent milk and calf production.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s16 \intbl\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\insrsid1133445\charrsid11022883 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs24\insrsid1133445\charrsid11022883 Signs of Heat}{\rtlch\fcs1 
