\par - Anti-inflammatory drugs to reduce fever and pain.
\par - Topical treatment of ulcers with antiseptics (e.g., povidone-iodine) and wound sprays.
\par - Supportive care: Provide soft feed, easy access to water, and clean, dry bedding.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs24\insrsid1058738\charrsid11022883 
