\par - Animal Identification (ID) Number or Name
\par - Date of Birth or Date of Purchase
\par - Breed and Genetic Lineage
\par - Calving History: Dates of all calvings
\par - Lactation Data: Duration of each milking period, daily milk yield, and 305-day lactation average
\par - Nutrition: Type and quantity of feed provided
\par - Reproductive History: Date of first observed heat, dates of breeding or Artificial Insemination (AI) (including sire/bull ID), pregnancy diagnosis date, expected calving date, actual calving date, and drying-off date
\par - Exit Information: Age and date of removal from the herd, and reason for removal (e.g., sale, culling, death)
